    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 817, top: 200, width: 391, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 9 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.75)' }}>01</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>决策早于证据</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.75, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.50)', marginTop: 8 }}>样机→量产的立项决策，发生在量产证据产生之前。这不是流程缺陷，是产品化的固有节奏。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 817, top: 334, width: 391, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.08)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 817, top: 350, width: 391, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 9 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.75)' }}>02</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>两端都不牢</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.75, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.50)', marginTop: 8 }}>样机端只有 n=1 的存在性证据；分布性证据要等 PVT 之后才产生。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 817, top: 484, width: 391, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.08)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 817, top: 500, width: 391, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
